+# Disk retention rules (log caps, version retention, locks, Windows-locked files): the same files in omnirush-cli (src/disk-cleanup/) and omnirush-gui (apps/desktop/electron/disk-cleanup/).
+# A change to one must be ported to the other and this list updated in both.
